From 2e29267c15a7431d2d071368b11658f4d042cf4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jamie <jamie@Jamies-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 22:10:26 +1200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: batch straggler detection, calibrated cancellation,
 retry-once, missing classification

BatchStragglerTracker in AsyncJobManager with owner+batch scoping,
max(floor, 2T) deadline, queued-job budget from actualStartedAt,
STRAGGLER_CANCEL_REASON for distinct abort identity.

TaskTool retry-once on straggler cancel with stragglerPolicy opt-in,
late-generation suppression, exhausted->missing classification.

8 tests, 79 assertions. Built binary regression smoke clean.
